ninto the formula, we obtain\n\n$$\nV=7\\cdot 2\\cdot 3=42\\,{\\text{in}}^{3}.\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186233065 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119891 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a97dc9e3-b5a4-5913-94c3-aea43e639ce8" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a Dimension of a Rectangular Solid Given Its Volume and Some Other Dimensions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "6ef8f255-f711-534a-8c3b-a00aeee8f4cf" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21\\text{ in}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539664} {:answer/id #uuid "b37aff71-fefe-5835-b812-37cbc998a5f3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9\\text{ in}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539787} {:answer/id #uuid "be300bcd-dbeb-50d8-b8ff-e656294f88fa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "24\\text{ in}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539810} {:answer/id #uuid "c6516385-c183-5a86-9bba-69b2101234a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18\\text{ in}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539822} {:answer/id #uuid "c76e7711-4986-52a4-9d5d-feabee2ea75a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "32\\text{ in}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539823}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c6516385-c183-5a86-9bba-69b2101234a2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "18\\text{ in}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539822} :answer-field/id #uuid "64f1ed4f-91f9-52d7-96d3-6559b0cf6609" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539961}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ab063eb3-e1ae-540f-a02b-e6ce9ad41bcd" :question/math-academy-id "q-10229" :question/problem "![](images/70/70fc259b5863513eabaf6b67eeb5e6b8debcb40d4a91d096f6515cb9f2efe642.png)\n\nDetermine the length of the rectangular solid above given that its volume is $720\\,{\\text{in}}^{3}.$" :question/worked-solution "We can find the volume $V$ of the rectangular prism using the formula\n\n$$\nV=lwh,\n$$\n\nwhere $l$ is the length, $w$ is the width, and $h$ is the height of the solid.\n\nSubstituting \n\n$$\nV=720,\\,w=5,\\,h=8\n$$\n\ninto the formula, we obtain the following\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}720 & =l\\cdot 5\\cdot 8 \\\\ 720 & =40l \\\\ l & =18\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the length is $18\\,\\text{in}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186540070 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119891 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "a97dc9e3-b5a4-5913-94c3-aea43e639ce8" :knowledge-point/title "Finding a Dimension of a Rectangular Solid Given Its Volume and Some Other Dimensions"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1628a242-f264-5605-9435-46727417ea83" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11\\text{ m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539524} {:answer/id #uuid "425e9417-f634-5c8f-8996-3e931cdc3b7c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9\\text{ m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539600} {:answer/id #uuid "432ba6f6-26b3-518f-871a-e1f91e9c7b54" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8\\text{ m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539603} {:answer/id #uuid "5d3784fb-09c4-56f5-bb03-0c4d51e5e003" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "10\\text{ m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539636} {:answer/id #uuid "ce779af8-e3eb-5993-aabf-ae537338e442" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "12\\text{ m}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186539834}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "425e9417-f634-5c8f-8996-3e931cdc3b7c" :answer/type 